zed time management and analytical problem-solving skills as part of a multi-disciplinary committee to provide impactful decisions, relevant for software development lifecycle. Demonstrated effective written and communication skills in collaborating with peers\n[0]Work Experience:\n[1]Job Title: PEY VR Technical Assistant\n[1]Company: Medica Providencia Clinic\n[1]Location: Tuxtla Gtz, CS, Mexico\n[1]Duration: 2022/12 - 2023/03\n[1]Description: Developed troubleshooting skills through systematic diagnostics and repairs, improving patient-centred approach. Collaborated with healthcare professionals to achieve improved satisfaction scores\n[0]Projects:\n[1]Project Title: TTRPG Tools\n[1]URL: https://github.com/Marneus981/TTRPGTools\n[1]Type: Open Source Personal Project\n[1]Duration: 2023/06 - Present\n[1]Description: Developed software tools with AI integration for playing and creating TTRPG Games, implementing automated debugging and scripting for all software components. Utilized C++/Python programming languages to create a comprehensive solution\n[1]Project Title: Horizontal Federated Learning Research\n[1]URL: github.com/alexjsenn/FedScale\n[1]Type: Research | Capstone Project\n[1]Duration: 2021/09 - 2022/06\n[1]Description: Developed a Federated Machine Learning model aggregation algorithm in C++/Python, doubling network efficiency while maintaining model performance. Co-authored technical papers and presentations on novel aggregation algorithms\n[1]Project Title: Neural Signal Modelling\n[1]URL: https://github.com/Marneus981/NeuralBioelectricityProject\n[1]Type: University Project\n[1]Duration: 2020/09 - 2020/12\n[1]Description: Coalesced research into a holistic simulation of neural signal transmission and propagation using MATLAB, applying knowledge of algorithms and object-oriented design principles. Demonstrated strong analytical problem-solving skills\n[0]Skills:\n[1]Programming Languages: Python, JavaScript\n[1]Technical Skills: Algorithms, Data Structures, Object-Oriented Design Principles, Machine Learning, Unit Testing\n[1]Soft Skills: Detail-Oriented, Good Written and Communication Skills, Teamwork, Time Management', 'job_description': '**Company Name:** Sentry  \n**Job Title:** Software Engineer, New Grad  \n\n**Key Responsibilities:**\n\n1. **Product Development & Enhancement**: Collaborate with a team to develop and extend the Sentry product using either Python or JavaScript (or both), focusing on the full software development lifecycle including design, development, testing, and production operations.\n\n2. **Effective Communication**: Maintain open communication with internal teams and stakeholders like product managers to ensure project alignment and successful outcomes.\n\n3. **Continuous Improvement**: Actively seek feedback and coaching from manager and teammates to improve skills and processes continuously.\n\n**Required Skills:**\n\n1. **Education**: Hold a B.S. or higher degree in Computer Science (or a related field) from an accredited institution.\n\n2. **Professional Experience**: Possess at least one previous internship or equivalent practical experience that demonstrates professional readiness.\n\n3. **Programming Proficiency**: Demonstrate implementation skills with at least one general-purpose programming language, such as Python, JavaScript, Java, etc., showcasing adaptability and technical capability.\n\n4. **Fundamental Knowledge**: Show a strong understanding of algorithms, data structures, and object-oriented design principles to ensure robust solution development.\n\n5. **Development Best Practices**: Have experience working with version control systems (e.g., Git) and unit testing frameworks to maintain high-quality code standards and automate testing processes effectively.', 'standard_calls': ['make_cover_letter_text'], 'non_standard_calls': []}
